@startuml Vacancy Creation Sequence

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor LightYellow
    BorderColor Gray
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor LightGreen
    BorderColor DarkGreen
}

title NotDjinni - Vacancy Creation Sequence Diagram

actor "Employer" as Employer
participant "System" as System
database "Database" as DB

== Vacancy Creation Request ==

Employer -> System: Submit vacancy details\n(title, description, salary, etc.)
activate System

== Get Employer Profile ==

System -> DB: Check employer profile
activate DB
DB --> System: Profile found with company
deactivate DB

alt Employer profile not found
    System --> Employer: Error: Create employer profile first
    deactivate System
end

== Validate Vacancy Data ==

System -> System: Validate vacancy details
note right: Check required fields,\nvalue ranges, valid options

== Create Vacancy ==

System -> DB: Record vacancy
activate DB
DB --> System: Vacancy created
deactivate DB

== Response ==

System --> Employer: Vacancy created successfully\nReceive vacancy details
deactivate System

@enduml
